# =================================================== #
                PROBLEM DESCRITION
# =================================================== #

DataFrame students:

+-------------+--------+
| Column Name | Type   |
+-------------+--------+
| student_id  | int    |
| name        | object |
| age         | int    |
+-------------+--------+

Write a solution to select the name and age of the student with student_id = 101.

# =================================================== #
                      SOLUTION
# =================================================== #


import pandas as pd

def selectData(students: pd.DataFrame) -> pd.DataFrame:
    
    id_mask = students['student_id'] == 101
    
    return students.loc[id_mask, ['name', 'age']]
